# Build mode is controlled by NEXT_PUBLIC_DEPLOY_TARGET (see lib/config.ts):
#
#   Vercel deploy : the Vercel CLI runs without overriding this var, so the
#                   default "vercel" mode applies — anonymous authors and
#                   NeurIPS venue keywords visible. Matches the double-blind
#                   review URL referenced by the paper abstract.
#
#   GH Pages      : .github/workflows/deploy.yml sets
#                   NEXT_PUBLIC_DEPLOY_TARGET=github at build time so the
#                   real author roster and Harry24k repo link are rendered,
#                   while every NeurIPS keyword is stripped from the eyebrow,
#                   metadata, and footer.
#
# An unattended `next build` (no env override) falls back to the safe
# anonymous + venue-visible mode, identical to the Vercel review build.
